  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "The libpq package provides the PostgreSQL client library, which allows client programs to connect to PostgreSQL servers. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* postgresql: PostgreSQL libpq: Buffer overflow allows server superuser to overwrite client stack memory (CVE-2026-6477)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
